        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "We had a glass fence installed for our pool, and the experience was excellent from start to finish. The installation went very smoothly and was completed quickly. Communication was great throughout—they responded fast and were patient with all our requests.\n\nThe quality of the work was flawless. We later needed some modifications, and they came the very next day to take care of them. They even noticed a few minor defects in the glass and replaced it right away without us having to ask.\n\nHighly recommend them for their professionalism, attention to detail, and outstanding service!",
        "time": 1746546153,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dino Stamatiou",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106189753642966910110/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJN-BaSCMm9dwvbIWtJFTo1kjerOc0qyzdYPfHLaiO5-L9-Ag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I had glass railings installed on my deck and front entrance and cannot be happier.  The job was extremely challenging but Chris and his team of professionals got the job done and it looks spectacular.  I highly recommend Clotures 12mil Spigot.",
        "time": 1695909640,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Francois Rabeau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106928395466614601803/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
