        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9FiLU7LgEP6zmkeERGz11SFn39ClxVqnAhT5wSPsgMA875tQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Installation of a glass fence around the balcony leading to the in-ground pool. The balcony's perimeter is irregular. The installation includes two self-closing gates. The work was carried out with rigor, precision, and a high level of professionalism, both in terms of the installation technique and the contractor's friendly manner. Installation was quick and easy. Highly recommended.",
